# Firebase SERVER credentials — never commit these.
# The service-account JSON lets anyone send notifications as Amul Dairy to
# every user of the app, and the .p8 is Apple's push key (downloadable only
# once). These belong on the SERVER, outside the webroot — not in this repo.
# NOTE: google-services.json and GoogleService-Info.plist are NOT secret;
# they are client config and are safe to commit, which is why they are not
# listed here.
*-firebase-adminsdk-*.json
service-account*.json
serviceAccountKey*.json
firebase-service-account*.json
*.p8

# Server-side PHP — deployed to the IIS server separately, not part of the
# React Native app repo. app_api/config_aml.php also holds DB credentials, so
# these folders must stay out of the repo entirely.
/app_api/
/digi forms/
